35	 *  (this family's own top tier + rate×extra beyond it, anti-undercut clamped)
36	 *  for a game config. See GameCustomPlanConfig's own doc for why these are NOT
37	 *  interchangeable — reusing the VPS formula with a game's floor swapped in
38	 *  would overstate the price more and more as the spec grows past the floor
39	 *  for any family whose floor price is anti-undercut-clamped. */
40	function previewPriceCents(spec: CustomPlanSpec, cfg: CustomPlanConfig | GameCustomPlanConfig): number {
41	  return isGameCfg(cfg)
