51	 * Money rules, same as the rest of the wizard:
52	 *  - The number that moves under the slider is a PREVIEW from the one shared
53	 *    formula (computeCustomPlanPriceCents) — instant, no round trip.
54	 *  - Continue is gated on the AUTHORITATIVE quote (quoteCustomPlanAction:
55	 *    guardrails + real capacity check) for exactly the spec on screen.
56	 *  - Continuing creates the one-off Plan/GamePlan row server-side
